"text": "Your outfit is built for a relaxed start to your autumn office day, balancing comfort with a polished silhouette. The black linen shirt provides a soft, easy drape that you can take off if the office gets warm or slip into a jacket when it cools down. Over it, the chocolate-toned puffer vest adds just enough structure to define your shape without feeling stiff. Below, the burgundy leather midi skirt introduces a rich texture and color contrast to keep things interesting. The black mules offer a comfortable, open-toe feel perfect for walking between floors, while the beige tote keeps your hands free and grounded in neutral tones.",
"how_to_wear": [
"You can layer the puffer vest over or under the linen shirt depending on how you want to feel; it acts as a soft outer shell without bulk. The black mules are slip-on shoes that go well with skirts and pants alike, giving you an effortless yet put-together look.",
"The leather skirt is structured enough to keep your lines clean even when you're moving all day. If the office gets cold, the vest becomes your main layer; if it's mild, wear it lightly over the shirt."
