"n": "#29·09",
"text": "This black linen shirt has a relaxed, oversized fit with long sleeves and a button-front closure. It’s lightweight and breathable, perfect for layering or wearing alone in mild weather."
},
{
"n": "#51·12",
"text": "The puffer vest is made from soft matte fabric and sits at hip length with a front zipper and quilted panels. Its muted chocolate tone complements your skin and adds warmth without bulk."
},
{
"n": "#172·36",
"text": "This midi skirt is crafted from structured leather in a deep burgundy hue, falling straight from the waist with clean seams that elongate your silhouette."
},
{
"n": "#272·10",
"text": "These black mules are made of smooth leather with a slightly curved sole and open back for easy slip-on wear. They’re designed for all-day comfort without sacrificing style."
},
{
"n": "#118·33",
"text": "This tote bag features a bold monogram print in beige tones with black straps and hardware. It’s spacious enough to carry your essentials and adds a playful touch to your neutral palette."
}
